    "title": "Columbus man arrested on felony drug charges after SODTF investigation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brea Spencer ,\n11 hours ago PORTSMOUTH, Ohio (WSYX) — A Columbus man is facing first-degree felony drug charges after Ohio State Highway Patrol troopers performed a traffic stop in Scioto County. Scioto County Sheriff David Thoroughman and Portsmouth Police Chief Debby Brewer announced the arrest following an investigation by the Southern Ohio Drug Task Force in coordination with the OSHP. Read full article\n3",
